# High-risk review (superseded)

**D-94 (2026-10-10) supersedes D-60.** Do **not** run `sonnet-instruct`, `high-risk-adversarial`, or `sonnet-verify`.

HIGH PRs get **one** Sonnet 5 review of the **final** diff. Record `security-gate-id:` (lowercase UUID or `bc-<uuid>`). How-to: `.cursor/rules/security-review-gate.mdc`. Tiers and non-negotiables: `.cursor/rules/lean-agent-process.mdc`.

Historical D-60 sequence (Sonnet plan → Composer → Grok adversarial → Sonnet verify → D-38) is retired. Discovery script: `scripts/verify-high-risk-loop-discovery.mjs` now asserts the D-94 one-review contract.
